Z||000000||jhogans||12-06-1999||08:09 PM||||Fiero Brothers and Sisters,<P>I am a proud owner of a 86 Fiero GT.  Thanks for all of the replys to my previous message.  Here is the 411 on the car.<P>Exterior - Rating 8.<BR>Interior - Ration 7.<P>Red<BR>5spd<BR>Factory Tape w/eq<BR>Subwoofer<BR>Power Windows, locks, mirrors.<BR>Defrost<BR>Spoiler<BR>I have the gray leather/suede seats.<P>The car is just down right beautiful.  I need to find somebody that has a digital camera so that I can take pictures and show you all.<P>I want to thank all of the people on this forum for helping me find my first Fiero.<P>BTW, Cooter.  I looked at that Fiero you bought.  They guy was about 15 miles from where I stayed.   I looked at it Saturday.  You are lucky that I was on my way out of town when I went to look at the car or I would have been an owner of 2 Red Fiero GTs (86 and 88).  The car is in need of some interior restoration.  That is why I didn't make any offer on the spot.  I was going to wait until today but I saw your message  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I wish you all the luck with your new Fiero||||reg||6
